        "gameplay-paragon": {
          "note": "Coin on public 10, credit on public 6 with the ball held on the outhole (8): the start fired 2, 7 and 17 and raised 19. One closure at a time: slingshots 36 and 35 fired 14 and 15; thumper bumpers 40, 39, 37 and 38 fired 11, 12, 1 and 13; saucers 31, 32 and 24 fired 8, 9 and 10. The in-line targets 4, 3, 2 and 1 fired nothing when the bank completed; target 2 lit lamp 6 (2X) and target 1 lamp 22 (3X). Completing the waterfall bank 17-19 fired 17. The spinner (33) lit lamp 14. Holding 84 raised 48 and holding 82 raised 46; holding 81 or 83 changed no output. PinMAME also raised 47 and 45 with 48 and 46; those are omitted here."
        },
        "solenoid-test-paragon": {
          "note": "Self-test pressed three times; the solenoid test then fires one output per second while showing its number on every player display. Paired with the number on player 1's display 0.25 s after each pulse, in test order 1 to 15: 1->7, 2->6, 3->8, 4->10, 5->9, 6->14, 7->15, 8->11, 9->12, 10->1, 11->13, 12->2, 13->17, 14->18, 15->19. Every later pulse of the run follows the same order (2 full cycles). Before the test, the power-on reset pulsed outputs 17, 18, 19, 20 together.",
